  "description": "Years of production: 2018 (limited edition)\n\nSee the current Solaris, our Reynolds 853 steel 29er hardtail.\n\nThe limited edition SodaMAX was our titanium uber-hardtail, the pinnacle of Cotic hardtail technology: the lightweight evolution of the SolarisMAX, our fastest hardtail made even faster.\n\nThe Soda was our original titanium hardtail, from 2005 to 2012, and was taken everywhere from local singletrack to the 2009 World XC Championships. In 2018 we brought it back with the MAX treatment, in a limited edition of just 20 frames.\n\nThe SodaMAX used the Longshot geometry of the award-nominated SolarisMAX for sweet, short-stem handling and unflappable composure at speed. It would take you from the race start line to your favourite singletrack in a blaze of acceleration, was unflappable on steep, technical lines, and loved long backcountry days with just a bottle and a frame bag for company. From suspension-forked, wide-barred trail warrior to Plus-tyred monster truck to map-crossing smoothie, it was an incredibly versatile bike.\n\nFinishes: brushed titanium with orange pinstripe and black panel, or fully polished with blasted graphics.\nSizes: Small, Medium, Large and XL. Wheels: 29\", or 27.5 Plus.",
